5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm looking forward to our trip! To make sure we're all comfortable, let's look at the logistics and costs carefully before we pick a destination.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is always such a joy to travel with you all. I agree, a thoughtful approach will ensure everyone feels happy and included.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to go somewhere fun! But I also want to make sure I can sleep well and that the place is nice.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with the need for a plan. I'd like to avoid any unnecessary stress or wasted time during the journey.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm excited too! I just want to make sure we have a clear idea of the total costs so there are no surprises later.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll check ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran"" to see how our group dynamics have worked in the past.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" would be very useful for fairness.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look at ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements"" to see how the daily routine works.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I'll investigate ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus"" to see how much time we'll spend traveling.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll check ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""Valley inn rates versus urban beds"" to get a sense of the overall pricing.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
