35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I've found that shared houses can leave us with no privacy, but separate days can make us feel disconnected. We need a balance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems that separate bookings can lead to unfair price differences, while all-in rates might be unfair to those who eat less.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,Some places have very strict mealtimes and everyone sleeps in one room on futons. Other places might have cold water in the baths.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Travel times vary wildly. Some options take two whole days just for the journey, while others are very quick and easy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The costs are quite different. Some options are a flat rate per building, while others vary greatly depending on the type of bed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, does the travel time significantly impact the feeling of the trip? I wonder if long journeys contribute to the fatigue.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, since you looked at pricing, do you think a flat rate for a whole building would be the most equitable for everyone?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't like the idea of everyone sleeping in one room or having cold water. I want a place where I can relax.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, yes, it does. Spending two days just moving and waiting can make the holiday feel like a chore rather than a rest.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, a whole-building let does seem simpler for the bill, but we have to consider the total cost including food.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, I understand. If we are too crowded, it might lead to that feeling of being overwhelmed I was worried about.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,It is important that no one feels they are paying more than their fair share. A transparent system is best.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, yes! I just want a place where I don't have to worry about the bathroom or the schedule too much.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I would strongly prefer a destination that is easy to reach. The less time we spend in transit, the better.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Jonathan. If we save time on travel, we can enjoy the destination more without feeling rushed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
