60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have three options: A is a Hot Spring Town, B is an Island Trip, and C is a City Break. Let's consider them.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option A has set meals and shared rooms, B is a rented house, and C has separate rooms and separate plans.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A has strict mealtimes and futons. Option B has one bathroom for everyone and potentially cold water. Option C has doors!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option A is a short train ride. Option B takes two days of travel. Option C is very easy to get around.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option A is a set rate with meals. Option B is a building rate plus food. Option C is separate and varies by person.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Option C might make us feel too separate, as we saw last year. Option B might be too crowded. Option A seems like a middle ground.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"Option B's single bill is fair, but Option A's all-in rate is also simple. Option C's separate costs could be problematic.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I really don't like Option B's bathroom situation. Option A's schedule is a bit scary, but Option C sounds the most comfortable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,Option B is out for me because of the travel time. Option A and C are both much more efficient.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I prefer Option A or B because the costs are more predictable. Option C feels like it could end up costing more than expected.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, if we choose Option A, we'll be together for meals, which prevents the isolation of Option C.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, if we want predictability, Option A's all-in rate is very clear, even if it's not perfectly precise for every eater.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I guess the meals are okay if I have a place to sit that isn't my bed. Is there a lounge in Option A?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,Option A is a ninety-minute train ride. That is ideal. I can't support Option B with its ferry schedules.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,Option A seems to balance the cost and the experience well. It's a set price and we don't have to worry about separate bills.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,I vote for Option A. It ensures we spend time together without the extreme crowding of a single house.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The simplicity of the arrangement in Option A avoids any quiet disputes over money. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm still worried about the futons, but the bathroom in Option B sounds worse. I'll vote for Option A.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"For the sake of my peace and the travel time, Option A is the best choice. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Midori,,It's the most predictable for the budget and sounds lovely. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
